You find many Jews. Left-wing Jews. Always on the side of whom? Hazard of the Arabs. The same thing is the one of Ben Nechar. Now that you see that there were people among the Jews who did not believe really in God, who did not believe in the uniqueness of our own Jewish people, you understand the continuation of the bashum.

