God did not direct the Jewish people to go to the short way to the land of Israel. You know why? Because it's too near. And then they have to face war and they will be afraid and they will return to Israel.

00:16:55.000 --> 00:17:17.000
Now one minute. Rambam has a question. What kind of explanation is this? God made for the Jews ten wonders. The great miracles. They go in the Jewish crowd, they go to war and fight in Israel. Why God doesn't make another miracle? What is the problem?

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:39.000
What is the problem? They don't have to face the enemy. Face the enemy? They don't have to face the enemy. Why? Because they could rely on the miracles. Rambam gives us here a very important principle. Rather two principles.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:18:05.000
Number one. Erez Yisrael never was given nor ever shall be given by miracles. It is our duty to take Erez Yisrael. Never Erez Yisrael will be given to us in a silver platter. Number one. Alright? So therefore, here it is. The Jewish people they have to take possession of Erez Yisrael on their own. That's number one.

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:31.000
Number two. God makes miracles in nature. God is willing to take a stone and to take water out of the stone. Water turned into blood. But God is not willing to take a coward and make him a courageous person. To take a stupid and make him intelligent. To take somebody lazy and make him diligent.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:44.000
This is up to us. God gave us the opportunity. In other words, God was able to make miracles. But not on the human being. This is up to us. You understand?

00:18:44.000 --> 00:19:00.000
Because he knew they were not ready. Because the people they are not ready. Their arm is still, is assimilated. Many of them they are not convinced. Alright?

