And therefore, I'm going to take him to the Red Sea. Instead of going north, west, north, east. I'm going to make him go south, west. Alright? And there is going to be the Red Sea. They're going to see the splitting of the Red Sea. And then by Yaa Aminu V'Adonai, with Moshe Avdo.

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:32.000
Yeah, I have a question. It says over here, a few lines later, it says they're not ready.

