When it comes to a point that this individual has been done so harm, that God does not want him to make teshuba, that this person doesn't reserve it, and therefore this leader, no matter what opportunities you're going to give him, he's going to always make what? The wrong choices. That is part of the punishment.

00:20:57.000 --> 00:21:21.000
Now, v'yasev Elohim et ha'am derecha midbar. And instead of letting them go north-east, God makes them turn and they go towards the desert. You know which desert? In the south. To the south. South-west. Yamsu.

