00:24:16.000 --> 00:24:41.000
So then, somebody who is greater than Yosef, buried him. You know who is greater than Yosef? Moshe. Because Moshe buried Yosef. Somebody greater than Moshe has to bury him. Who buried Moshe? Yosef buried his father.

00:24:41.000 --> 00:24:52.000
He had the zechun to have somebody greater than him bury him. Who was Moshe? Moshe buried Yosef. Moshe Rabbenu was buried by whom? By God. Isn't it beautiful?

