Now. Now. V'yachanu lifne piyahiyot ve-migdol u-benayam. Migdol is the migdal. When they had people, the military, always in mountains or hills, looking, you know, they had like a migdal, like a high hill, where military observation posts. U-benayam. And the other side, they had the sea. Alright?

00:32:07.000 --> 00:32:30.000
Lifne ba'as epon. And there was a guard for ba'as epon. In front of this guard, nikho, right in front of it, kahanu. You must camp, alayam, by the seashore. Do you have any place where to go? No. No place where to go. You put yourself where? In a trap. Alright?

00:32:31.000 --> 00:32:57.000
But all says, how stupid these Jewish people are. They're really stupid. First of all, they go instead, they want to go to Israel. Instead of going north to the north, northeast, they go southwest. Why do they go to southwest? Yes, instead of continuing all over the world, they go, what? Northeast? And they put themselves in the worst military position you could ever imagine. Alright?

